and paralysis, keen senses, spell resistance 16, vulnerability to fire; AL CE; SV Fort +12, Ref +9, Will +9; Str 19, Dex 10, Con 17, Int 8, Wis 11, Cha 10\n\nSkills and Feats: Concentration +6, Diplomacy +3, Escape Artist +3, Hide -1, Intimidate +3, Knowledge (any 1) +8, Listen +20, Move Silently +3, Search +17, Sense Motive +3, Spot +20, Swim +7, Use Magic Device +3; Alertness, Hover, Improved Initiative, Power Attack, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw)','\n      <div topic=\"White Dragon\" level=\"4\"><p><h4>White Dragon</h4></p><p/><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\"><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td><b>White Dragon, Young adult</b><br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td>Large Dragon (Cold)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Hit Dice:</b><br/></td><td>15d12+45 (142 hp)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Initiative:</b><br/></td><td>+4<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Speed:</b><br/></td><td>60 ft., burrow 30 ft., fly 200 ft. (poor), swim 60 ft.<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Armor Class:</b><br/></td><td>23 (-1 size, +14 natural), touch 9, flat-footed 23<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Base Attack/Grapple:</b><br/></td><td>+15/+23<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Attack:</b><br/></td><td>Bite +19 (2d6+4) melee<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Full Attack:</b><br/></td><td>Bite +19 (2d6+4) melee, 2 Claws +19 (1d8+2) melee, 2 Wings +18 (1d6+2) melee, Tail Slap +18 (1d8+6) melee<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Space/Reach:</b><br/></td><td>10 ft./5 ft. (10 ft. with bite)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Special Attacks:</b><br/></td><td>Breath weapon (40 ft. cone of cold 5d6, DC 20), frightful presence (DC 17)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Special Qualities:</b><br/></td><td>Blindsense 60 ft., damage reduction 5/magic, darkvision 120 ft., <i>fog cloud</i>, icewalking, immunity to cold, immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, spell resistance 16, vulnerability to fire<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Saves:</b><br/></td><td>Fort +12, Ref +9, Will +9<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Abilities:</b><br/></td><td>Str 19, Dex 10, Con 17, Int 8, Wis 11, Cha 10<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Skills:</b><br/></td><td>Concentration +6, Diplomacy +3, Escape Artist +3, Hide -1, Intimidate +3, Knowledge (any 1) +8, Listen +20, Move Silently +3, Search +17, Sense Motive +3, Spot +20, Swim +7, Use Magic Device +3<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Feats:</b><br/></td><td>Alertness, Hover, Improved Initiative, Power Attack, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Environment:</b><br/></td><td>Cold mountains<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Organization:</b><br/></td><td>Solitary or clutch (2-5)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Challenge Rating:</b><br/></td><td>8<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Treasure:</b><br/></td><td>Triple standard<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Alignment:</b><br/></td><td>Always chaotic evil<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Advancement:</b><br/></td><td>16-17 HD (Large)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Level Adjustment:</b><br/></td><td>-<br/></td></tr>\n\n</table><p/><p/><p/><div topic=\"Dragon\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Dragon (Cold)</b></p>\n</div><div topic=\"Environment\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Environment:</b> Cold mountains</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Organization\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Organization:</b> Wyrmling, very young, young, juvenile, and young adult: solitary or clutch (2-5); adult, mature adult, old, very old, ancient, wyrm, or great wyrm: solitary, pair, or family (1-2 and 2-5 offspring)</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Challenge Ratings\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Challenge Ratings:</b> Wyrmling 2; very young 3; young 4; juvenile 6; young adult 8; adult 10; mature adult 12; old 15; very old 17; ancient 18; wyrm 19; great wyrm 21</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Treasure\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Treasure:</b> Triple standard</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Alignment\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Alignment:</b> Always chaotic evil</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Advancement\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Advancement:</b> Wyrmling 4-5 HD; very young 7-8 HD; young 10-11 HD; juvenile 13-14 HD; young adult 16-17 HD; adult 19-20 HD; mature adult 22-23 HD; old 25-26 HD; very old 28-29 HD; ancient 31-32 HD; wyrm 34-35 HD; great wyrm 37+ HD</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Level Adjustment\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Level Adjustment:</b> Wyrmling +2; very young +3; young +3; juvenile +5; others -</p><p/>\n</div><div topic=\"White Dragons by Age\" level=\"5\"><p><h5>White Dragons by Age</h5></p><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\">\n\n<tr maxcol=\"17\" curcol=\"17\">\n<td><b>Age</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Size</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Hit Dice (hp)</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Str</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Dex</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Con</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Int</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Wis</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Cha</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Base Attack/</b><br/>\n<b>Grapple</b><br/></td> <td><b>Attack</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Fort Save</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Ref Save</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Will Save</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Breath Weapon (DC)</b><br/></td>\n<td><b>Frightful Presence DC</b><br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr maxcol=\"17\" curcol=\"17\">\n<td>Wyrmling<br/></td>\n<td>T<br/></td>\n<td>3d12+3 (22)<br/></td>\n<td>11<br/></td>\n<td>10<br/></td>\n<td>13<br/></td>\n<td>6<br/></td>\n<td>11<br/></td>\n<td>6<br/></td>\n<td>+3/-5<br/></td>\n<td>+5<br/></td>\n<td>+4<br/></td>\n<td>+3<br/></td>\n<td>+3<br/></td>\n<td>1d6 (12)<br/></td>\n<td>-<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"17\" curcol=\"17\">\n<td>Very