t.<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>23 (-1 size, +14 natural), touch 9, flat-footed 23<br/></td>\n<td>Damage reduction 5/magic<br/></td>\n<td>-<br/></td>\n<td>16<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Adult<br/></td>\n<td>60 ft., burrow 30 ft., fly 200 ft. (poor), swim 60 ft.<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>26 (-1 size, +17 natural), touch 9, flat-footed 26<br/></td>\n<td><i>Gust of wind</i><br/></td>\n<td>1st<br/></td>\n<td>18<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Mature adult<br/></td>\n<td>60 ft., burrow 30 ft., fly 200 ft. (poor), swim 60 ft.<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>28 (-2 size, +20 natural), touch 8, flat-footed 28<br/></td>\n<td>Damage reduction 10/magic<br/></td>\n<td>3rd<br/></td>\n<td>20<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Old<br/></td>\n<td>60 ft., burrow 30 ft., fly 200 ft. (poor), swim 60 ft.<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>31 (-2 size, +23 natural), touch 8, flat-footed 31<br/></td>\n<td><i>Freezing fog</i><br/></td>\n<td>5th<br/></td>\n<td>21<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Very old<br/></td>\n<td>60 ft., burrow 30 ft., fly 200 ft. (poor), swim 60 ft.<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>34 (-2 size, +26 natural), touch 8, flat-footed 34<br/></td>\n<td>Damage reduction 15/magic<br/></td>\n<td>7th<br/></td>\n<td>23<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Ancient<br/></td>\n<td>60 ft., burrow 30 ft., fly 200 ft. (poor), swim 60 ft.<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>37 (-2 size, +29 natural), touch 8, flat-footed 37<br/></td>\n<td><i>Wall of ice</i><br/></td>\n<td>9th<br/></td>\n<td>24<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Wyrm<br/></td>\n<td>60 ft., burrow 30 ft., fly 250 ft. (clumsy), swim 60 ft.<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>38 (-4 size, +32 natural), touch 6, flat-footed 38<br/></td>\n<td>Damage reduction 20/magic<br/></td>\n<td>11th<br/></td>\n<td>25<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr maxcol=\"8\" curcol=\"8\">\n<td>Great wyrm<br/></td>\n<td>60 ft., burrow 30 ft., fly 250 ft. (clumsy), swim 60 ft.<br/></td>\n<td>+0<br/></td>\n<td>41 (-4 size, +35 natural), touch 6, flat-footed 41<br/></td>\n<td><i>Control weather</i><br/></td>\n<td>13th<br/></td>\n<td>27<br/></td>\n\n</tr>\n</table><p>The scales of a wyrmling white dragon glisten like mirrors. As the dragon ages, the sheen disappears, and by very old age, scales of pale blue and light gray are mixed in with the white.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Combat\" level=\"5\"><p><h5>Combat</h5></p><p>White dragons prefer sudden assaults, swooping down from aloft or bursting from beneath water, snow, or ice. They loose their breath weapon, then try to knock out a single opponent with a follow-up attack.</p><div topic=\"Breath Weapon\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Breath Weapon (Su):</b> A white dragon has one type of breath weapon, a cone of cold.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Icewalking\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Icewalking (Ex):</b> This ability works like the <i>spider climb</i> spell, but the surfaces the dragon climbs must be icy. It is always in effect.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Freezing Fog\" level=\"8\"><p><b><i>Freezing Fog</i> (Sp):</b> An old or older white dragon can use this ability three times per day. It is similar to a <i>solid fog</i> spell but also causes a rime of slippery ice to form on any surface the fog touches, creating the effect of a <i>grease</i> spell. The dragon is immune to the <i>grease</i> effect because of its icewalking ability. This ability is the equivalent of a 5th-level spell.</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Other Spell-Like Abilities\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Other Spell-Like Abilities:</b> 3/day-<i>fog cloud</i> (juvenile or older), <i>gust of wind</i> (adult or older), <i>wall of ice</i> (ancient or older); 1/day-<i>control weather</i> (great wyrm).</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Skills\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Skills:</b> Hide, Move Silently, and Swim are considered class skills for white dragons.</p><p/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n    ','SRD 3.5 MonstersDr-Dw');
INSERT INTO monster VALUES (264,'Dragon, True','White Dragon, Old',NULL,'Huge','Dragon','Cold','24d12+120 (276 hp)','+4','60 ft., burrow 30 ft., fly 200 ft. (poor), swim 60 ft.','31 (-2 size, +23 natural), touch 8, flat-footed 31','+24','+41','Bite +32 (2d8+9) melee','Bite +32 (2d8+9) melee, 2 Claws +32 (2d6+4) melee, 2 Wings +31 (1d8+4) melee, Tail Slap +31 (2d6+13) melee','15 ft.','10 ft. (15 ft. with bite)','Breath weapon (50 ft. cone of cold 8d6, DC 27), crush 2d8+13 (DC 27), frightful presence (DC 23)','Blindsense 60 ft., damage reduction 10/magic, darkvision 120 ft., fog cloud, freezing fog, gust of wind, icewalking, immunity to cold, immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, spell resistance 21, spells (caster level 5th), vulnerability to fire','Fort +19, Ref +14, Will +15','Str 29, Dex 10, Con 21, Int 12, Wis 13, Cha 12','Concentration +14, Diplomacy +10, Escape Artist +9, Hide +1, Intimidate +10, Knowledge (any 1) +28, Listen +30, Move Silently +9, Search +28, Sense Motive +10, Spot +30, Swim +18, Use Magic Device +10',NULL,'Alertness, Empower Spell, Flyby Attack, Hover, Improved Initiative, Maximize Spell, Power Attack, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw)',NULL,'Cold mountains','Solitary, pair, or family (1-2 and 2-5 offspring)','15','Triple standard','Always chaotic evil','25-26 HD (Huge)','-','Blindsense (Ex), Breath Weapon (Su), Crush (Ex), Freezing Fog (Sp), Frightful Presence (Ex), Icewalking (Ex), Immunities (Ex), Keen Senses (Ex), Spell Resistance (Ex), Tail Sweep (Ex)','Old white dragon; CR 15; Huge dragon (cold); HD 24d12+120; hp 276; Init +4; Spd 60 ft., burrow 30 ft., fly 200 ft. (poor), swim 60 ft.; AC 31 (-2 size, +23 natural), touch 8, flat-footed 31; Base Atk +24; Grp +41; Atk +32 melee (2d8+9, bite); Full Atk +32 melee (2d8+9, bite) and +32 melee (2d6+4, 2 claws) and +31 melee (1d8+4, 2 wings) and +31 melee (2d6+13, tail slap); Space/Reach 15 ft./10 ft. (15 ft. with bite); SA Breath weapon (50 ft. cone of cold 8d6, DC 27), crush 2d8+13 (DC 27), frightful presence (DC 23); SQ Blindsense 60 ft., damage reduction 10/magic, darkvision 120 ft., fog cloud, freezing fog, gust of wind, icewalking, immunity to cold, immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, spell resistance 21, spells (caster level 5th), vulnerability to fire; AL CE; SV Fort +19, Ref +14, Will +15; Str 29, Dex 10, Con 21, Int 12, Wis 13, Cha 12\n\nSkills and Feats: Concentration +14, Diplomacy +10, Escape Artist +9, Hide +1, Intimidate +10, Knowledge (any 1) +28, Listen +30, Move Silently +9, Search +28, Sense Motive +10, Spot +30, Swim +18, Use Magic Device +10; Alertness, Empower Spell, Flyby Attack, Hover, Improved Initiative, Maximize Spell, Power Attack, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw)','\n      <div topic=\"White Dragon\" level=\"4\"><p><h4>White Dragon</h4></p><p/><p/><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\"><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td><b>White Dragon, Old</b><br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td>Huge Dragon (Cold)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Hit Dice:</b><br/></td><td>24d12+120 (276 hp)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Initiative:</b><br/></td><td>+4<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Speed:</b><br/></td><td>60 ft., burrow 30 ft., fly 200 ft. (poor), swim 60 ft.<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Armor Class:</b><br/></td><td>31 (-2 size, +23 natural), touch 8, flat-footed 31<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Base Attack/Grapple:</b><br/></td><td>+24/+41<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Attack:</b><br/></td><td>Bite +32 (2d8+9) melee<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Full Attack:</b><br/></td><td>Bite +32 (2d8+9) melee, 2 Claws +32 (2d6+4) melee, 2 Wings +31 (1d8+4) melee, Tail Slap +31 (2d6+13) melee<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Space/Reach:</b><br/></td><td>15 ft./10 ft. (15 ft. with bite)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Special Attacks:</b><br/></td><td>Breath weapon (50 ft. cone of cold 8d6, DC 27), crush 2d8+13 (DC 27), frightful presence (DC 23)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Special Qualities:</b><br/></td><td>Blindsense 60 ft., damage reduction 10/magic, darkvision 120 ft., <i>fog cloud</i>, <i>freezing fog</i>, <i>gust of wind</i>, icewalking, immunity to cold, immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, spell resistance 21, spells (caster level 5th), vulnerability to fire<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Saves:</b><br/></td><td>Fort +19, Ref +14, Will +15<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Abilities:</b><br/></td><td>Str 29, Dex 10, Con 21, Int 12, Wis 13, Cha 12<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Skills:</b><br/></td><td>Concentration +14, Diplomacy +10, Escape Artist +9, Hide +1, Intimidate +10, Knowledge (any 1) +28, Listen +30, Move Silently +9, Search +28, Sense Motive +10, Spot +30, Swim +18, Use Magic Device +10<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Feats:</b><br/></td><td>Alertness, Empower Spell, Flyby Attack, Hover, Improved Initiative, Maximize Spell, Power Attack, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Environment:</b><br/></td><td>Cold mountains<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Organization:</b><br/></td><td>Solitary, pair, or family (1-2 and 2-5 offspring)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Challenge Rating:</b><br/></td><td>15<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Treasure:</b><br/></td><td>Triple standard<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Alignment:</b><br/></td><td>Always chaotic evil<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Advancement:</b><br/></td><td>25-26 HD (Huge)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Level Adjustment:</b><br/></t