of repulsion gas or 100 ft. line of lightning 12d6, DC 25), crush 2d8+12 (DC 25), frightful presence (DC 25); SQ Alternate form, blindsense 60 ft., create food and water, damage reduction 5/magic, darkvision 120 ft., fog cloud, immunity to electricity, immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, speak with animals, spell resistance 22, spells (caster level 7th), water breathing; AL LG; SV Fort +17, Ref +12, Will +17; Str 27, Dex 10, Con 21, Int 20, Wis 21, Cha 20\n\nSkills and Feats: Concentration +22, Diplomacy +22, Disguise +22, Escape Artist +17, Intimidate +22, Knowledge (any 2) +29, Listen +31, Search +29, Sense Motive +22, Spot +31, Survival +21, Swim +25, Use Magic Device +22; Alertness, Empower Spell, Flyby Attack, Hover, Improved Initiative, Power Attack, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw)','\n      <div topic=\"Bronze Dragon\" level=\"4\"><p><h4>Bronze Dragon</h4></p><p/><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\"><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td><b>Bronze Dragon, Adult</b><br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td>Huge Dragon (Water)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Hit Dice:</b><br/></td><td>21d12+105 (241 hp)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Initiative:</b><br/></td><td>+4<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Speed:</b><br/></td><td>40 ft., fly 150 ft. (poor), swim 60 ft.<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Armor Class:</b><br/></td><td>28 (-2 size, +20 natural), touch 8, flat-footed 28<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Base Attack/Grapple:</b><br/></td><td>+21/+37<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Attack:</b><br/></td><td>Bite +28 (2d8+8) melee<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Full Attack:</b><br/></td><td>Bite +28 (2d8+8) melee, 2 Claws +28 (2d6+4) melee, 2 Wings +27 (1d8+4) melee, Tail Slap +27 (2d6+12) melee<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Space/Reach:</b><br/></td><td>15 ft./10 ft. (15 ft. with bite)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Special Attacks:</b><br/></td><td>Breath weapon (50 ft. cone of repulsion gas or 100 ft. line of lightning 12d6, DC 25), crush 2d8+12 (DC 25), frightful presence (DC 25)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Special Qualities:</b><br/></td><td>Alternate form, blindsense 60 ft., <i>create food and water</i>, damage reduction 5/magic, darkvision 120 ft., fog cloud, immunity to electricity, immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, <i>speak with animals</i>, spell resistance 22, spells (caster level 7th), water breathing<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Saves:</b><br/></td><td>Fort +17, Ref +12, Will +17<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Abilities:</b><br/></td><td>Str 27, Dex 10, Con 21, Int 20, Wis 21, Cha 20<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Skills:</b><br/></td><td>Concentration +22, Diplomacy +22, Disguise +22, Escape Artist +17, Intimidate +22, Knowledge (any 2) +29, Listen +31, Search +29, Sense Motive +22, Spot +31, Survival +21, Swim +25, Use Magic Device +22<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Feats:</b><br/></td><td>Alertness, Empower Spell, Flyby Attack, Hover, Improved Initiative, Power Attack, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Environment:</b><br/></td><td>Temperate hills<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Organization:</b><br/></td><td>Solitary, pair, or family (1-2 and 2-5 offspring)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Challenge Rating:</b><br/></td><td>15<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Treasure:</b><br/></td><td>Triple standard<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Alignment:</b><br/></td><td>Always lawful good<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Advancement:</b><br/></td><td>2