+41 melee (2d6+6, 2 wings) and +41 melee (2d8+18, tail slap); Space/Reach 20 ft./15 ft. (20 ft. with bite); SA Breath weapon (60 ft. cone of repulsion gas or 120 ft. line of lightning 20d6, DC 33), crush 4d6+18 (DC 33), frightful presence (DC 33), tail sweep 2d6+18 (DC 33); SQ Alternate form, blindsense 60 ft., control water, create food and water, damage reduction 15/magic, darkvision 120 ft., detect thoughts, fog cloud, immunity to electricity, immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, speak with animals, spell resistance 28, spells (caster level 15th), water breathing; AL LG; SV Fort +25, Ref +18, Will +25; Str 35, Dex 10, Con 25, Int 24, Wis 25, Cha 24\n\nSkills and Feats: Concentration +39, Diplomacy +39, Disguise +39, Escape Artist +32, Intimidate +39, Knowledge (any 3) +43, Listen +45, Search +43, Sense Motive +39, Spot +45, Survival +38, Swim +43, Use Magic Device +39; Alertness, Blind-Fight, Empower Spell, Flyby Attack, Hover, Improved Initiative, Maximize Spell, Power Attack, Snatch, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw), Wingover','\n      <div topic=\"Bronze Dragon\" level=\"4\"><p><h4>Bronze Dragon</h4></p><p/><p/><p/><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\"><tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td><b>Bronze Dragon, Ancient</b><br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td/><td>Gargantuan Dragon (Water)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Hit Dice:</b><br/></td><td>33d12+231 (445 hp)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Initiative:</b><br/></td><td>+4<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Speed:</b><br/></td><td>40 ft., fly 200 ft. (clumsy), swim 60 ft.<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Armor Class:</b><br/></td><td>38 (-4 size, +32 natural), touch 6, flat-footed 38<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Base Attack/Grapple:</b><br/></td><td>+33/+57<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Attack:</b><br/></td><td>Bite +42 (4d6+12) melee<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Full Attack:</b><br/></td><td>Bite +42 (4d6+12) melee, 2 Claws +42 (2d8+6) melee, 2 Wings +41 (2d6+6) melee, Tail Slap +41 (2d8+18) melee<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Space/Reach:</b><br/></td><td>20 ft./15 ft. (20 ft. with bite)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Special Attacks:</b><br/></td><td>Breath weapon (60 ft. cone of repulsion gas or 120 ft. line of lightning 20d6, DC 33), crush 4d6+18 (DC 33), frightful presence (DC 33), tail sweep 2d6+18 (DC 33)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Special Qualities:</b><br/></td><td>Alternate form, blindsense 60 ft., <i>control water</i>, <i>create food and water</i>, damage reduction 15/magic, darkvision 120 ft., <i>detect thoughts</i>, fog cloud, immunity to electricity, immunity to sleep and paralysis, keen senses, <i>speak with animals</i>, spell resistance 28, spells (caster level 15th), water breathing<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Saves:</b><br/></td><td>Fort +25, Ref +18, Will +25<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Abilities:</b><br/></td><td>Str 35, Dex 10, Con 25, Int 24, Wis 25, Cha 24<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Skills:</b><br/></td><td>Concentration +39, Diplomacy +39, Disguise +39, Escape Artist +32, Intimidate +39, Knowledge (any 3) +43, Listen +45, Search +43, Sense Motive +39, Spot +45, Survival +38, Swim +43, Use Magic Device +39<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Feats:</b><br/></td><td>Alertness, Blind-Fight, Empower Spell, Flyby Attack, Hover, Improved Initiative, Maximize Spell, Power Attack, Snatch, Weapon Focus (bite), Weapon Focus (claw), Wingover<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Environment:</b><br/></td><td>Temperate hills<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Organization:</b><br/></td><td>Solitary, pair, or family (1-2 and 2-5 offspring)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Challenge Rating:</b><br/></td><td>22<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Treasure:</b><br/></td><td>Triple standard<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Alignment:</b><br/></td><td>Always lawful good<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Advancement:</b><br/></td><td>34-35 HD (Gargantuan)<br/></td></tr>\n<tr maxcol=\"3\" curcol=\"3\"><td><b>Level Adjustment:</b><br/></td><td>-<br/></td></tr>\n\n</table><p/><div topic=\"Dragon\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Dragon (Water)</b></p>\n</div><div topic=\"Environment\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Environment:</b> Temperate hills</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Organization\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Organization:</b> Wyrmling, very young, young, juvenile, and young adult: solitary or clutch (2-5); adult, mature adult, old, very old, ancient, wyrm, or great wyrm: solitary, pair, or family (1-2 and 2-5 offspring)</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Challenge Ratings\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Challenge Ratings:</b> Wyrmling 3; very young 5; young 7; juvenile 9; young adult 12; adult 15; mature adult 17; old 19; very old 20; ancient 22; wyrm 23; great wyrm 25</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Treasure\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Treasure:</b> Triple standard</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Alignment\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Alignment:</b> Always lawful good</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Advancement\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Advancement:</b> Wyrmling 7-8 HD; very young 10-11 HD; young 13-14 HD; juvenile 16-17 HD; young adult 19-20 HD; adult 22-23 HD; mature adult 25-26 HD; old 28-29 HD; very old 31-32 HD; ancient 34-35 HD; wyrm 37-38 HD; great wyrm 40+ HD</p>\n</div><div topic=\"Level Adjustment\" level=\"8\"><p><b>Level Adjustment:</b> Wyrmling +4; very young +4; young +6; others -</p><p/>\n</div><div topic=\"Bronze Dragons by Age\" level=\"5\"><p><h5>Bronze Dragons by Age</h5></p><table width=\"100%\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"2\" frame=\"VOID\" rules=\"ROWS\">\n\n<tr maxcol=\"17\" cur